        <Text>
            <GUID>9855</GUID>
            <Text>Reinforcements have arrived to attend the exhibition for its entire duration.</Text>            <!-- Visitors have arrived to attend the exhibition for its entire duration. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>21607</GUID>
            <Text>Every time reinforcements arrive, there's a chance that a special reinforcement will appear, willing to join your city.</Text>            <!-- Every time a shipment of visitors arrives, there's a chance that a guest will appear. Guests are specialists who are willing to join your city. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>21606</GUID>
            <Text>Reinforcements give additional income. Increase your city's attractiveness to get more icome with every reinforcement.</Text>            <!-- Visitors generate regular income. Increase your city's attractiveness to get more visitors. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>19854</GUID>
            <Text>Build a Reinforcement Drop Zone to get reinforcements to your island.</Text>            <!-- Build a public mooring to attract visitors to your island. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>17461</GUID>
            <Text>Reinforcements can't arrive on your island via your Trading Post! You'll need to build a Reinforcements Harbour for them.</Text>            <!-- Visitors can't arrive on your island via your Trading Post! You'll need to build a public mooring for them. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>11645</GUID>
            <Text>You should always try to improve your city's attractiveness. Reinforcements from around the world are waiting to help you in your battles!</Text>            <!-- You should always try to improve your city's attractiveness. Visitors from around the world are waiting to discover the marvels your island has to offer! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>11303</GUID>
            <Text>REINFORCEMENTS WELCOME!</Text>            <!-- VISITORS WELCOME! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>10822</GUID>
            <Text>Reinforcements and Culture</Text>            <!-- Visitors and Culture -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3995</GUID>
            <Text>Build a Reinforcements Harbour to start welcoming reinforcements to your island.</Text>            <!-- Build a public mooring to start welcoming visitors to your island. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3093</GUID>
            <Text>REINFORCEMENTS FLOODING IN!</Text>            <!-- VISITORS FLOODING IN! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3071</GUID>
            <Text>EAGER FIRST REINFORCEMENTS VISITORS ARRIVE!</Text>            <!-- EAGER FIRST VISITORS ARRIVE! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3072</GUID>
            <Text>As first reinforcements arrive in [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName], there is belief that town can quickly become a popular destination for soldiers who are willing to fight for their country.</Text>            <!-- As first visitors arrive in [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName], there is belief that town can quickly become a popular destination for tours and excursions, and that its many features and amenities can have a lasting appeal. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3085</GUID>
            <Text>REINFORCEMENTS VANISH!</Text>            <!-- VISITORS VANISH! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3086</GUID>
            <Text>Reinforcements desert [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName] in favour of more attractive destinations. "We want to be fighting for the winning side" soldiers laments. Is our city really not strong enough to face the opponent? Full assessment p. 23.</Text>            <!-- Visitors desert [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName] in favour of more attractive destinations. "We just aren't getting anywhere near as much trade this season," tour operator laments. Is our city really that ugly? Full assessment p. 23. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3009</GUID>
            <Text>Your infrastructure is adapted. Increase your attractiveness to attract more reinforcements.</Text>            <!-- Your infrastructure is adapted. Increase your attractiveness to attract more visitors. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3008</GUID>
            <Text>Connect your Reinforcements Harbour to the city's network to welcome reinforcements.</Text>            <!-- Connect your Visitors' Harbour to the city's network to welcome visitors. -->
        </Text>
