        <Text>
            <GUID>2370</GUID>
            <Text>Increase your city attractiveness to gain more Reinforcements and special equipment and military specialists.</Text>            <!-- Increase your city attractiveness to gain more visitors and special visits. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>22538</GUID>
            <Text>Increase your Reinforcements count to maximise the chances of special equipment and military specialists arriving.</Text>            <!-- Increase your visitor count to maximise the chances of specialists arriving. -->
