        <!-- VISITOR HAS JOINED -->
        <Text>
            <GUID>23466</GUID>
            <Text>Reinforcements are ready to serve after arriving at [NotificationContext Value(Area) Area CityName]'s Reinforcements Harbour.</Text>            <!-- A special visitor has joined your city after arriving at [NotificationContext Value(Area) Area CityName]'s Public Mooring. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260269</GUID>
            <Text>Attention! New reinforcements are here!</Text>            <!-- This city is a magnet for genius. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260270</GUID>
            <Text>Another amazing arrival, ready to go to war.</Text>            <!-- We're in the presence of a virtuoso! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260271</GUID>
            <Text>How exiting, the new reinforcememts are looking good!</Text>            <!-- How thrilling! A renowned personage has arrived! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260116</GUID>
            <Text>I've finally arrived! Ready to go to war!</Text>            <!-- I've finally arrived! Now to see if the journey was worth it. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260117</GUID>
            <Text>Ready to serve for my country!</Text>            <!-- Finally terra firma! I cannot wait to look around and explore. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260118</GUID>
            <Text>The perfect day for shooting some rounds!</Text>            <!-- Lovely day for seafront perambulation! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260119</GUID>
            <Text>I'm writing a postcard to my family back home - Ahem - just need someone to deliver it?</Text>            <!-- I'm writing a postcard - Ahem - just need someone to deliver it? -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260120</GUID>
            <Text>The rations are high quality here. I have had worse food!</Text>            <!-- My portmanteau has spilled out everywhere! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260121</GUID>
            <Text>The canteen is so loud, I like to eat in a quiet place.</Text>            <!-- Oh! Do you have a luncheon recommendation? -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260122</GUID>
            <Text>We were getting some beers together, do you want to join us?</Text>            <!-- Good thing you caught me, we are about to take tea! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260128</GUID>
            <Text>I experience so much gratitute from our leaders!</Text>            <!-- And at no additional cost? -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>260129</GUID>
            <Text>I feel the love for our country and will do whatever needed to protect my family!</Text>            <!-- What an unexpected treat! -->
        </Text>
